// Verbatim lowercase: server names in the latency table, header names with
// RFC 1918 addresses, the reason phrases as the servers spell them, and the unit
// "s" after a decimal (0.44 s), which the checker reads as a domain name.
// nimiCheck: allow s cloudflare apache github gse litespeed vercel squarespace netlify microsoft-iis amazons3 cloudfront caddy akamaighost varnish neocities openbsd httpd x-loopia-node x-upstream x-backend-ip x-sc-lb x-cache-backendip authory moved healthy available for the backend

tenpo suno lili la mi pali kepeken ilo alasa mi, [ilo lawa](@lawa). mi toki e ijo mute lon lipu pi nimi tawa ni. taso mi kama sona e ijo musi sin. ona li ni:

nimi pi nimi sewi la sitelen suli li ante. ilo lawa li lukin e linja 7,400,000 pi nimi sewi. ona la 74.6% li jo e sitelen suli lon open pi nimi ale. 19.0% li sitelen lili ale. 4.4% li kepeken nasin tu lon nimi wan. 1.9% li sitelen suli ale. ni li musi: *nimi sewi ante* la nanpa ni li ante kin. nimi sewi Set-Cookie li sitelen lili lon tenpo 40%. nimi sewi Date li sitelen lili lon tenpo 5%. nasin HTTP/2 li wile e sitelen lili ale. tan ni la pilin mi li ni: ilo pana HTTP/2 li lon monsi. ilo pana HTTP/1.1 li lon sinpin. nimi sewi ante li kama tan ma ante.

ijo pi mute lili: SERVER (63), Last-modified (39), X-Powered-by (5), cache-Control (4).

ilo pana ante la tenpo awen li ante kin:

