## ilo pi pali lipu

tenpo ni kin la lipu 767 li tan ilo Microsoft FrontPage. mi lukin kin e ilo ni: ilo Netscape Composer (`Mozilla/4.79 [en] (Win98; U) [Netscape]`), ilo Adobe GoLive, ilo Adobe PageMill, ilo Claris Home Page, ilo HotDog, ilo NetObjects Fusion, ilo AceHTML, ilo Arachnophilia, ilo Amaya, ilo “Internet Assistant for Microsoft Word 2.0z”, en ilo Microsoft WordPad.

